Package: l1spectralclustering
Title: Reproducible analysis for l1-regularized spectral clustering
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Magali", "Champion", , "magali.champion@math.uzh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1639-641X"))
    person("Camille", "Champion", , "camille.champion@parisdescartes.fr", role = "aut"),
  )
Description: Provides a comprehensive framework for reproducing the results, 
    simulations, and real-world applications presented in the 
    manuscript " $\ell_1$-spectral clustering algorithm: a spectral clustering 
    method using $\ell_1$-regularization". The package includes synthetic data 
    generation, benchmarking against state-of-the-art methods,
    and tools for performance evaluation and visualization.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
